### Create organization
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/organizations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Personal Workspace"
}

###

### Get organizations
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/organizations

###

### Create project
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationId": "d9e446a6-c314-413a-8573-2a621495f565",
  "name": "Brand Engine",
  "description": "AI-assisted brand and domain research project"
}

###

### Get projects
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/projects

###
